# Generated script for tests/presentation/*.toml (M6D D3b-3, docs/HIGH_FPS.md section 15). CONTINUE from the
# Shadow Depths fixture; keyboard and mouse. Segments (log marks): walk (the character and the following camera move;
# a freeze draws the held interval at fixed alphas), turn (6 degrees per tick with the mouse; frozen half way), flick
# (270 degrees in one tick: wraps the right way), orbit (looking up 3 degrees per tick; frozen half way), back down
# in one tick, a 180-degree turn away and the right-stick click (V): the game centres its own camera at once.
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1100 press Return
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return
@gameplay+300 log mark start
@gameplay+300 down W
@gameplay+320 log mark walk
@gameplay+350 freeze 2 walk
